        "settingsKey": null,
        "settingsUdi": null
      }
    ]
  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Stoolball is a sport that owes much of its unique appeal to the fact that it should be played not only within its rules but also within the spirit of the game. Any action which is seen to abuse this spirit causes injury to the sport itself.]]></Value>
    </description>
